## Tests

The suite. Its root is layerExempt, so a test may import any layer (G-007) - but nothing below may import a test.

### `tests/code-map.test.ts`

- **purpose** — Pin the code map — the header parser, the renderer, the layer rules, the impact walk, and this project's own headers and rendered map.
- **inputs** — the exports of scripts/code-map.mjs, fixture module sources, a scratch project carrying the real CLI, and this project root
- **outputs** — vitest assertions and the check summary line on stdout
- **effects** — disk (reads this project; writes and removes a scratch project under the OS temp dir), process (spawns the real CLI)
- **errors** — none beyond assertion failures
- **callers** — —
- **callees** — `scripts/code-map.mjs`

